 Online Form 2024</a></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Download UPPSC Exam Calendar 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Steps to Check &amp; Download:</strong></span></h3>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Visit the Official Website</strong>:</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Go to the Uttar Pradesh Public Service Commission (UPPSC) website: <a target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">www.uppsc.up.nic.in</a>.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Search the Exam Calendar Link</strong>:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">On the homepage, look for the <strong>“Exam Calendar 2026”</strong> link under the <strong>Information Bulletin</strong> or <strong>What’s New</strong> section.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Open and View the Calendar</strong>:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on the link to open the exam calendar PDF.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Review the dates and schedule for various UPPSC exams.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Download the PDF</strong>:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click the <strong>Download</strong> button or save the PDF to your device for future reference.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: cen